# Line endings are part of the test fixtures: `core.autocrlf=true` (the
# Windows default) rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, and the golden corpus is
# compared byte for byte. Pin everything to LF so a fresh clone on any machine
# checks out the bytes the tests were written against.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images are not text and must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
